# cell-annotation skill configuration (template — copy to .env and edit).
#
# `skills/cell-annotation/scripts/common.py:load_skill_dotenv()` auto-loads
# this `.env.example` (and the skill's own `.env` if present) into os.environ
# at import time. Priority: shell env > .env > .env.example.
# Disable: `export CELL_ANNOTATION_SKIP_DOTENV=1`.
#
# SCOPE: only Neo4j connection credentials live here. The harness does not
# know Neo4j exists (it only owns loop-level config: LLM gateway, RAG toggles).
# Skill-level KG query parameters (--species-type, --min-confidence, --gene-key,
# --max-ancestor-hops) are LLM-facing argparse parameters; they are NOT here.
#
# Recognized keys: `common.SKILL_DOTENV_KEYS` in skills/cell-annotation/scripts/common.py.

# ─── Neo4j / knowledge graph ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required by step3_kg (KG queries) and scripts/build_label_map.py. Password
# has no default — the skill refuses to connect without one.
NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
NEO4J_USER=neo4j
# NEO4J_PASSWORD=